@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand drops
Forehand drops, two minutes. Two halves. First, counter-drops: two metres from the front wall, close
to the side wall, soft drops just above the tin, kept going. Then feed from just behind the short
line, play one drop, and let it go. Phase two target: six out of ten with the second bounce before
the short line, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
0:15 Open face. Soft hands.
1:00 Now feed, drop, and let it go. Score ten.
1:30 Step in with your front foot. Stay low.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
